  "_comment": "validator \u2014 Signs and proposes. API private by contract (sentries front it); needs devnet.keystore_path with the consensus key. Sentries dial this node. Reference example (ADR-069); fill the <placeholders> and devnet.validators from genesis. Run: pqcd devnet-serve /etc/pqchain/node.json",
  "node_id": "validator-1",
